      "why": {
        "zh": "走读 01 从这里看见一层空楼。这一次楼是满的，站在这里的是一个人——一年二十三个里的一个。他需要的四样东西，没有一样是今天建的。",
        "en": "Walkthrough one saw an empty plate from here. This time the floor is full and what is standing here is a person — one of about twenty-three this year. Not one of the four things they need gets built today."
      },
      "criteria": {
        "zh": [
          "入职约 23 人/年",
          "离职约 17 人/年 🧭",
          "约每六个工作日一次事件"
