      "segment": "seg-staff",
      "label": {
        "zh": "触发器 · 谁说了算",
        "en": "The trigger — what decides"
      },
      "why": {
        "zh": "哪个系统说了算：这个人还不还是员工？必须有一个，有名字的，别的都信它。如果答案是「一张工单」，下游的一切都会迟到或不全。",
        "en": "What system decides whether a person is still an employee? There has to be one, named, that everything else believes. If the answer is a ticket, everything downstream is late or incomplete."
      },
      "criteria": {
        "zh": [
          "一个有名字的权威源",
          "组 = 岗位职能 或 权限束，绝不两者都是",
          "两个 break-glass 账号"
        ],
        "en": [
          "One named source of truth",
          "A group means a job function or an access bundle, never both",
          "Two break-glass accounts"
        ]
      },
