      "segment": "seg-unpatchable",
      "label": {
        "zh": "库房 · 一层货架",
        "en": "The store — one shelf"
      },
      "why": {
        "zh": "箱子周四到的。库房要盖住的是下一批货到之前来报到的新人，加上同一个月坏掉的机器。这是交付周期的数，不是库存政策——所以它是一层货架，不是一个房间。",
        "en": "The box arrived on Thursday. The store covers the joiners arriving before the next order lands plus the machines that die in that month. A lead-time number, not a stock policy — which is why it is a shelf and not a room."
      },
      "criteria": {
        "zh": [
          "约 5 台备机",
          "一年约 44 台进、38 台出",
          "一扇能锁的门"
        ],
        "en": [
          "About 5 spares",
          "About 44 in and 38 out a year",
          "A door that locks"
        ]
      },
