      "segment": "seg-staff",
      "label": {
        "zh": "服务台 · 在动线上",
        "en": "Service desk — on the route"
      },
      "why": {
        "zh": "从电梯到工位会经过它，这不是巧合。把同一个位置挪进后勤办公室，走过来问的人就变成开工单的人——没人决定要改变工作量，有人只是挪了一张桌子。",
        "en": "The walk from the lift to the desk goes past it, and that is not an accident. Move the same position into a back office and walk-ups become tickets. Nobody decided to change the workload; somebody moved a desk."
      },
      "criteria": {
        "zh": [
          "在动线上，从开放区看得见",
          "靠着取件的库房",
          "靠着它作为第一响应人的机柜"
        ],
        "en": [
          "On the circulation route, visible from the floor",
          "Beside the store it draws stock from",
          "Beside the rack it is first responder for"
        ]
