      "segment": "seg-staff",
      "label": {
        "zh": "工位 · 七十张里的一张",
        "en": "The desk — one of seventy"
      },
      "why": {
        "zh": "一台从没开过机的机器。它问的是「拿着我的人是谁」，不是「我是什么」。镜像不在这栋楼里——厂商发货前就把它登记到了公司名下，开机第一次联网自己拉策略。",
        "en": "A machine that has never been switched on. It asks who is holding it, not what it is. The image does not live in this building: the vendor registers it before it ships and first boot pulls its own policy."
      },
      "criteria": {
        "zh": [
          "零接触，镜像归 OS 厂商",
          "前提是身份先做对了",
          "否则这是套着零接触外衣的重装项目"
        ],
        "en": [
          "Zero-touch, the image is mostly the OS vendor's",
          "Only if the identity work was done first",
          "Otherwise it is a re-imaging project in costume"
        ]
      },
