      "segment": "seg-management",
      "label": {
        "zh": "机柜 · 网络问同一个问题",
        "en": "The rack — the network asks the same question"
      },
      "why": {
        "zh": "802.1X，背后是 RADIUS，再背后是签发那个账号的同一个目录。端口什么都不决定：这台机器抱到哪张桌子上，落到的段都一样。",
        "en": "802.1X, behind it RADIUS, and behind that the same directory that issued the account. The port decides nothing — carry the machine to any desk and it lands in the same place."
      },
      "criteria": {
        "zh": [
          "认证决定段，端口不决定",
          "管理接口只从管理段可达",
          "约 11 个管理接口"
        ],
        "en": [
          "Authentication picks the segment, the port does not",
          "Management interfaces reachable only from the management segment",
          "About 11 management interfaces"
        ]
      },
