      "segment": "seg-staff",
      "label": {
        "zh": "员工段 · 每年动四十次",
        "en": "Staff — forty events a year"
      },
      "why": {
        "zh": "他落在这里，因为他通过了认证。这是四个段里唯一一个高频变动的：一年四十次人员事件、八十二次设备事件，每一次都有主人、有日期、有工单。",
        "en": "They land here because they authenticated. It is the only one of the four that churns: forty people events and eighty-two device events a year, each with an owner, a date and a ticket."
      },
      "criteria": {
        "zh": [
          "认证过的人和他们的受管设备",
          "约 100 台在役，升到 130",
          "高峰日约 130 个关联"
        ],
        "en": [
          "Authenticated humans and their managed devices",
          "About 100 endpoints in service rising to 130",
          "About 130 associations on the peak day"
        ]
      },
