    {
      "id": "seg-unpatchable",
      "kind": "segment",
      "at": [
        14,
        24
      ],
      "segment": "seg-unpatchable",
      "label": {
        "zh": "打不了补丁的 · 二十六份没人看的凭据",
        "en": "Unpatchable — 26 credentials nobody reviews"
      },
      "why": {
        "zh": "门禁控制器、打印机、房间系统、电话亭设备。因为要 802.1X，它们每一样都持有一份凭据。一次离职会强制审查一个人的权限；没有任何东西会强制审查一台门禁控制器的。",
        "en": "Door controllers, printers, room systems, booth devices. Because 802.1X is required, each one holds a credential. A leaver forces a review of one person's access. Nothing forces a review of a door controller's."
      },
      "criteria": {
        "zh": [
          "约 26 样，几乎从不变动",
          "厂商固件按厂商的节奏",
          "装修时签发，租约到期还在"
        ],
        "en": [
          "About 26 things, changing almost never",
          "Vendor firmware on a vendor's schedule",
          "Issued at fit-out, still there when the lease ends"
        ]
      },
